      {
        "@value": "Target firing angle. It is converter\u0027s control variable used in power flow. It is only applicable for rectifier if continuous tap changer control is used. Allowed values are within the range minAlpha less than or equal to targetAlpha less than or equal to maxAlpha. The attribute shall be a positive value.",
        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
