    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "Modified IEEE DC2A direct current commutator exciter with speed input, one more leg block in feedback loop and without underexcitation limiters (UEL) inputs. DC type 2 excitation system model with added speed multiplier, added lead-lag, and voltage-dependent limits.",
