        "@value": "IEEE PF controller type 2 which is a summing point type controller making up the outside loop of a two-loop system. This controller is implemented as a slow PI type controller. The voltage regulator forms the inner loop and is implemented as a fast controller. Reference: IEEE 421.5-2005, 11.4.",
        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
